#: ../../source/models/model_abilities/rerank.rst:119
msgid ""
"The model virtualenv settings pin the validated backend versions: "
"``sentence-transformers[image]==6.1.0`` with ``transformers==5.20.0`` for"
" Sentence Transformers, ``transformers==5.20.0`` for native Transformers,"
" and ``vllm==0.32.0`` with ``transformers==5.19.0`` for vLLM. Use "
"separate virtual environments for these backends. Model virtualenv "
"settings install their respective dependencies automatically."
msgstr ""
"As configurações dos ambientes virtuais do modelo fixam as versões "
"validadas dos backends. Para Sentence Transformers, use ``sentence-"
"transformers[image]==6.1.0`` com ``transformers==5.20.0``. Para o backend"
" nativo do Transformers, use ``transformers==5.20.0``. Para vLLM, use "
"``vllm==0.32.0`` com ``transformers==5.19.0``. Use um ambiente virtual "
"separado para cada backend. As configurações dos ambientes virtuais do "
"modelo instalam automaticamente as dependências correspondentes."

#: ../../source/models/model_abilities/rerank.rst:126
msgid ""
"Hugging Face uses ``nvidia/Nemotron-3.5-Rerank-8B-BF16`` at revision "
"``main``; ModelScope uses ``nv-community/Nemotron-3.5-Rerank-8B-BF16`` at"
" revision ``master``. Select the download hub with ``--download_hub "
"huggingface`` or ``--download_hub modelscope`` when launching."
msgstr ""
"O Hugging Face usa ``nvidia/Nemotron-3.5-Rerank-8B-BF16`` na revisão "
"``main``. O ModelScope usa ``nv-community/Nemotron-3.5-Rerank-8B-BF16`` "
"na revisão ``master``. Ao iniciar o modelo, selecione a origem do "
"download com ``--download_hub huggingface`` ou ``--download_hub "
"modelscope``."

